    "普通生成：runtime / customCallDispatch / taskResultQuery -> localizeTaskAsset -> importRemoteAsset -> attachStoredAssetPreview -> catalogTaskResultParse",
    "远程补救本地化：resultMediaBackfillBridge.relocalizeNode -> importRemoteAsset",
    "拖拽 / 文件导入：assetImportAdapter -> importLocalFile -> copyAssetFile / writeAsset -> attachStoredAssetPreview",
    "制作流程 / Agent / MCP 落图：generationOutputMaterializer -> writeDeterministicAsset -> ProductionArtifact -> multiShotCanvasLanding",
